# AgentVault — Windsurf / Cascade

Follow `AGENTS.md` §1 Workspace Entry Protocol exactly. Do not invent a shorter entry.
Handoff on interrupt is mandatory: `AGENTS.md` §3.
Cascade memories are supplementary. `.agentvault/` owns task routing and handoff;
MemoryBank owns leases and the journal. Never create `.agentvault/MemoryBank/`
or `workspace/SESSION_STATE.json`.
